    <!-- SCRUM-55 chaos-gate perf fix (live defect 2026-07-16): the v2 view stack
         evaluated latest-row dedup as correlated NOT EXISTS OR-arms per tx row,
         which CRDB executes as nested-loop lookups over ix_*_emission (5k rows
         per probe on a 12,001-tx parent). The prg_report_due scan then paid that
         quadratic cost twice per parent and hung 7+ minutes, permanently wedging
         the AGT ReportTrigger (ConcurrentExecution.SKIP). The stack is rebuilt
         set-based: one window pass per response table (the pick views below),
         hash joins everywhere else, and supporting composite indexes here. -->
    <!-- Per-index changesets with indexExists MARK_RAN guards (file convention,
         persistence.md): each converges independently on any reachable DB state,
         including databases that already carry one of these indexes (e.g. from
         the interim unsplit 003-reporting-read-indexes changeset). -->
