    <!-- Live-upgrade helpers: the v2 due/sla views depend on ext_tx_status.
         CRDB v26.2 tolerates a same-signature CREATE OR REPLACE under
         dependents (probed 2026-07-16), but that behavior is version-specific;
         dropping both here makes the upgrade order deterministic on every CRDB
         line. Both are recreated below by their runOnChange changesets (their
         bodies change in this same edit, so both re-execute). Fresh DBs
         MARK_RAN: neither view exists at this file position. -->
    <changeSet id="003-drop-report-due-v1-upgrade" author="dcre">
